-- title:
--   Regularity of the X₁(Mp) two-chart model after unramified base change
-- statement:
--   Fix a prime $p$ and a natural number $M$ with $5 \le M$ and $p \nmid M$, a field $L$ of characteristic zero that is a cyclotomic extension of $\mathbb{Q}$ of order $p$, and a primitive $p$-th root of unity $\zeta \in L$. Let $K$ be an intermediate field of $L \subseteq \mathrm{LaurentSeries}\,L$ equal to [`ModularCurve.laurentBaseChange L (ModularCurve.x1FunctionField (M * p))`](def/ModularCurve_LaurentCoeff.html#L103), i.e. the subfield generated over $L$ by the image of the intermediate field `x1FunctionField (M * p)` of $\mathbb{Q} \subseteq \mathrm{LaurentSeries}\,\mathbb{Q}$ under the coefficientwise map `coeffEmb L` induced by $\mathbb{Q} \to L$. Let $A$ be a discrete valuation domain with fraction field $L$, with $p$ in its maximal ideal and $\zeta$ in the image of $A$, and let $K$ be an $A$-algebra compatibly with $L$. Let $j \in K$ be nonzero with image in $\mathrm{LaurentSeries}\,L$ the $q$-expansion `coeffEmb L ModularCurve.jq`, namely $q^{-1}$ times the power series `jNumQ`. Finally let $O$ be a discrete valuation domain and $\rho_O \colon A \to O$ a ring homomorphism with $\mathfrak{m}_A O = \mathfrak{m}_O$. Then every point of the fibre product of [`ModularCurve.TwoChart.modelTo A K j`](def/ModularCurve_TwoChartModel.html#L252) (the structure map to $\operatorname{Spec} A$ of the pushout gluing $\operatorname{Spec}$ of the $A$-subalgebras of $K$ generated by $j$ and by $j^{-1}$) along $\operatorname{Spec}\rho_O$ has regular local stalk.
--
--   This is the ascent of regularity of the integral two-chart model of $X_1(Mp)$ over the localisation of $\mathbb{Z}[\zeta_p]$ at $p$ to an unramified discrete valuation ring extension, the base-change step preceding the study of the Jacobian and its Picard functor over $O$. It is used in the construction of the invertible kernel attached to the base-changed model.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_XOneP_isRegularLocalRing_stalk_pullback_of_map_maximalIdeal_eq_twoChartModel_x1_mul.lean

